  "duration": 76.9066875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.18,
      "text": "Sometimes, working with AI feels like having a PhD-level expert right at your side."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.74,
      "end": 9.34,
      "text": "Other times, it makes a mistake you'd expect from a six-year-old."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.14,
      "end": 11.82,
      "text": "How can the same tool do both?"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.78,
      "end": 16.4,
      "text": "AI isn't magic, a person, or even ordinary software."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.84,
      "end": 21.32,
      "text": "To explain why it has these blind spots, we need to look at what happens inside."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.1,
      "end": 23.26,
      "text": "Think about driving a car."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.66,
      "end": 26.22,
      "text": "You can get pretty good at it without ever opening the hood."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.8,
      "end": 33.26,
      "text": "But knowing what happens underneath the metal helps you understand exactly what the car can do and why something might go wrong."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.0,
      "end": 35.2,
      "text": "The same goes for AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.9,
      "end": 36.94,
      "text": "Time to look under the hood."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.86,
      "end": 40.94,
      "text": "Knowing how it works helps you be smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.56,
      "end": 44.72,
      "text": "We are going to take you inside the machine one piece at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.5,
      "end": 49.02,
      "text": "Some of this will be new to you, but each piece builds on the one before it."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.32,
      "end": 50.64,
      "text": "You don't need to memorize every term."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.98,
      "end": 54.4,
      "text": "The goal is to understand how your words become an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.02,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "This section will help you answer three specific questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.86,
      "end": 60.26,
      "text": "Where does AI get all that knowledge?"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.0,
      "end": 63.48,
      "text": "How does AI seem to understand what I ask?"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.14,
      "end": 65.8,
      "text": "How does AI come up with its answers?"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.52,
      "end": 68.36,
      "text": "The machine won't feel like magic anymore."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.18,
      "end": 70.16,
      "text": "Take it a piece at a time."
    }
  ],
